Single-database configuration for Flask-Migrate.

For a new empty database, apply migrations from the repo root:

  flask --app app db upgrade

For an existing database that already has the initial tables, stamp it once:

  flask --app app db stamp head

Do not run the initial upgrade against an existing unstamped database that already has
the tables. Alembic will try to create those tables again.

After an existing database is stamped, future schema changes use:

  flask --app app db migrate -m "describe schema change"
  flask --app app db upgrade
